-Offline verification covers strict response rejection, page coverage, literal preservation, nested output limits and fingerprinting, real guarded agent permissions, saved invalid responses, zero-send replay, and unchanged MinerU processing. A separately authorized live trial and source comparison establish only the observed page's fidelity.
